!Basic between IP addresses
monitor capture CAP interface GigabitEthernet1/0/1 both
monitor capture CAP match ipv4 host 192.168.0.1 host 192.168.1.1
monitor capture CAP buffer circular size 50
monitor capture CAP limit duration 180
monitor capture mycap export flash:CAP.pcap
!
!
monitor capture CAP stop
!
monitor capture CAP start
!
monitor capture CAP clear
no monitor capture CAP
